WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.526
This video follows an agent through a piece of work:

00:00:04.526 --> 00:00:09.753
an offer, the call, calls from the dialer, protecting card details, and wrap-up.

00:00:09.753 --> 00:00:13.340
It also shows where an agent reviews recent activity.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:23.390
Offers, live calls and wrap-up need a connected phone provider and a real caller.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:27.900
The site used for this video has neither, and never places a call.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:32.893
So the screens that appear only during a call are described on slides,

00:00:32.893 --> 00:00:34.624
with the words they show.

00:00:34.624 --> 00:00:39.760
The screens that exist without a call, such as Recent activity, are shown as they are.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:48.169
When routing picks you for a call, an offer card appears in My

00:00:48.169 --> 00:00:51.140
workspace, and the docked agent bar opens.

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:54.420
It shows the caller, the queue and a countdown.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:57.771
Click Accept before the countdown ends.

00:00:57.771 --> 00:01:03.550
The card reads Answering while the call connects, then the call moves into Active interaction.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:05.721
Or click Decline.

00:01:05.721 --> 00:01:10.539
The caller goes back to the queue and is offered to another agent first.

00:01:10.539 --> 00:01:15.173
If you do nothing, the offer ends with the countdown, and the queue's

00:01:15.173 --> 00:01:17.520
Unanswered offer action applies.

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:22.962
If you accept but your phone cannot be reached, the caller is not lost.

00:01:22.962 --> 00:01:29.177
The unanswered action applies, and your state changes to Away with the reason Phone unreachable.

00:01:29.177 --> 00:01:32.650
Check the phone, then set yourself Available again.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:40.602
When you are signed in to a campaign, the dialer gives you calls

00:01:40.602 --> 00:01:42.800
in the way its dialer profile sets.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:46.606
With Preview, the bar shows the offer with Dial and Skip, and the

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:49.500
activity opens so you can read the record first.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.726
With power and progressive dialing, you press nothing.

00:01:53.726 --> 00:01:56.622
The dialer places the call and reserves you.

00:01:56.622 --> 00:02:01.198
The bar says Waiting for a connected call, and the Complete activity page

00:02:01.198 --> 00:02:03.110
opens as the call connects.

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:09.045
You are Reserved while the dialer calls, and On a call only once a person answers.

00:02:09.045 --> 00:02:13.818
If nobody answers, or a machine does, the dialer records the outcome itself

00:02:13.818 --> 00:02:16.410
and you go straight back to Available.

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:25.659
When your administrator allows it, the Active interaction panel shows Pause recording.

00:02:25.659 --> 00:02:30.159
Use it while the customer reads out card details, and click Resume recording

00:02:30.159 --> 00:02:31.750
as soon as they finish.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:37.543
Collect data securely creates a one-time link for the customer to type their

00:02:37.543 --> 00:02:39.942
card details on their own device.

00:02:39.942 --> 00:02:42.033
Only a masked value is kept.

00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:46.400
You, your supervisor and the recording never see the full number.

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:51.413
While a recording is paused, supervisors cannot listen in.

00:02:51.413 --> 00:02:55.410
Every pause and resume is recorded in the audit trail.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:04.291
A call from a queue or a campaign puts you in Wrap-up when it ends.

00:03:04.291 --> 00:03:06.728
Wrap-up does not end on a timer.

00:03:06.728 --> 00:03:09.550
You end it by completing the activity.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:17.469
Click Complete activity, check the customer and activity details, pick a disposition, add notes, and save.

00:03:17.469 --> 00:03:21.630
You return to Available, or the break you asked for starts.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:27.584
If an activity is left open, wrap-up ends by itself after fifteen minutes,

00:03:27.584 --> 00:03:30.577
a setting your administrator can change.

00:03:30.577 --> 00:03:34.480
The activity stays open, with no disposition recorded.

00:03:38.761 --> 00:03:44.577
In My workspace, the Recent activity panel lists the interactions you finished most recently:

00:03:44.577 --> 00:03:49.277
the direction, the customer, the outcome, when it ended and the talk time.

00:03:49.277 --> 00:03:53.331
It says No recent interactions until you finish your first one.

00:03:53.885 --> 00:03:56.426
The soft phone keeps your history too.

00:03:56.426 --> 00:04:01.105
The Recent tab lists your latest calls, inbound and outbound, with a button

00:04:01.105 --> 00:04:02.837
to call the number back.

00:04:02.837 --> 00:04:06.245
It is empty here, because this site has had no calls.

00:04:06.864 --> 00:04:10.597
The Voicemail tab lists the voicemails left for you.

00:04:10.597 --> 00:04:12.914
Both tabs update as calls end.

00:04:17.114 --> 00:04:22.944
A support agent who accepts a call, helps the customer, and records the outcome in wrap-up.

00:04:23.694 --> 00:04:29.214
A sales agent on a preview campaign, who reads the record before pressing Dial.

00:04:29.964 --> 00:04:34.984
A billing agent who pauses the recording while a customer reads a card number.

00:04:35.734 --> 00:04:40.874
An agent who declines a call because they must leave, and lets another agent take it.

00:04:42.874 --> 00:04:49.117
Accept the offer, protect sensitive details, finish in wrap-up, and check your recent activity.

00:04:49.117 --> 00:04:50.724
Thanks for watching.

